                                "example_id": "967af718-2f21-43c1-be2e-ecf5a9b3adef",
                                "sense_id": "37946e66-061e-3320-8301-fbf53ee06427",
                                "text": "Ar. […]and for the reſt o'th' Fleet\n (Which I diſpers'd) they all haue met againe,\n And are vpon the Mediterranean Flote\n Bound ſadly home for Naples,\n Suppoſing that they ſaw the Kings ſhip wrackt,\n And his great perſon periſh."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
